WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:04.130
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:06.170
No fake family horror stories!

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:10.420
The Bright family has seen more than its fair
share of trauma, from Dr. Bright's poor brother

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:12.599
TJ, to his vengeful father.

00:00:12.599 --> 00:00:17.810
There is no reason to invent even more trauma
on top of that, so Dr. Bright, please stop

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:21.930
telling new Foundation recruits made-up horror
stories about your family.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.930
We can't keep sending them all to the counselor.

